#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Distance in millimeters before the end of slowed perimeters where the original print speed is gradually restored. This reduces quality issues when transitioning from slowed features to fast external perimeter printing.\n\nOnly applies when 'Consistent surface' cooling logic is selected.\nRecommended value: 5-10mm. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "喺減速周邊末端之前嘅毫米距離，其中原始打印速度逐漸恢復。呢個減少喺減速特徵同快速外部周邊打印之間過渡時嘅質量問題。\n\n僅適用於選擇\"一致表面\"冷卻邏輯時。\n推薦值：5-10毫米。設為0以禁用。"

