#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Top paint penetration layers"
msgstr "頂部塗色滲透層數"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "This is  the number of layers of top paint penetration."
msgstr "呢個係頂部塗色滲透嘅層數。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
