msgstr "底部塗色滲透層數"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "This is the number of layers of bottom paint penetration."
msgstr "呢個係底部塗色滲透嘅層數。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Use infill instead of top and bottom surfaces"
msgstr "用填充圖紋代替封閉嘅頂面同底面"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
