msgstr "應用"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Periodic modifier apply layers"
msgstr "週期修改器應用層"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Number of consecutive layers in each cycle on which this modifier is fully applied. The cycle starts at layer 0: first Apply for, then Skip for."
msgstr "每個週期入面完全應用呢個修改器嘅連續層數。週期從第 0 層開始：首先應用，然後跳過。"

